{"title": "Portrait of Marcus Miles", "pageid": 12972, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Portrait_of_Marcus_Miles", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items", "Divinity references"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Portrait_of_Marcus_Miles_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Portrait_of_Marcus_Miles_Icon.png/300px-Portrait_of_Marcus_Miles_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/3/3c/Portrait_of_Marcus_Miles_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Portrait of Marcus Miles image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Portrait_of_Marcus_Miles_Icon.png/300px-Portrait_of_Marcus_Miles_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Portrait_of_Marcus_Miles_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Portrait of Marcus Miles</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Painting\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Painting\">painting</a>, and a <a href=\"/wiki/Cultural_references\" title=\"Cultural references\">reference</a> to one of the playable characters from the Larian Studios game '<b>Divinity: Original Sin II'</b>. In this game <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://dos2.wiki/wiki/Marcus_Miles\">Marcus Miles</a> is better known as <i>Beast</i>, a cousin of a dwarven queen.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A brusque-looking dwarf is picked out in broad, evocative brushstrokes. His magnificent hat is bettered only by his beard.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 1.05 kg (2.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 1.05 kg (2.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 35 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  35  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-e13275ac9eb7c1b8END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-ac5407acfb7bb344END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">DLC_DD_Painting_Portrait_Beast</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:DLC_DD_Painting_Portrait_Beast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:DLC_DD_Painting_Portrait_Beast\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">1469200a-4419-4c9a-916f-6362378234bb</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:1469200a-4419-4c9a-916f-6362378234bb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:1469200a-4419-4c9a-916f-6362378234bb\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Hanging above a bed on the third floor (Bedroom) of the <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Tower\" title=\"Arcane Tower\">Arcane Tower</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-46&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-269</span></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This item is only available if the <a href=\"/wiki/Digital_Deluxe_Upgrade\" title=\"Digital Deluxe Upgrade\">Digital Deluxe Upgrade</a> was purchased.</li>\n<li>This item is part of series of paintings which depict characters of <i>Divinity: Original Sin II</i>:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Portrait_of_Fane\" title=\"Portrait of Fane\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Portrait_of_Fane_Item_Icon.png/30px-Portrait_of_Fane_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Portrait_of_Fane_Item_Icon.png/45px-Portrait_of_Fane_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Portrait_of_Fane_Item_Icon.png/60px-Portrait_of_Fane_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Portrait_of_Fane_Item_Icon.png/30px-Portrait_of_Fane_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Portrait_of_Fane_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Portrait_of_Fane\" title=\"Portrait of Fane\">Portrait of Fane</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Portrait_of_Ifan_ben-Mezd\" title=\"Portrait of Ifan ben-Mezd\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_of_Ifan_ben-Mezd_Item_Icon.png/30px-Portrait_of_Ifan_ben-Mezd_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_of_Ifan_ben-Mezd_Item_Icon.png/45px-Portrait_of_Ifan_ben-Mezd_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_of_Ifan_ben-Mezd_Item_Icon.png/60px-Portrait_of_Ifan_ben-Mezd_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_of_Ifan_ben-Mezd_Item_Icon.png/30px-Portrait_of_Ifan_ben-Mezd_Item